{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"torch_wall","model_identifier":"torch_wall","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# torch_wall\n\nWall torch: a torch in an iron bracket. The back plate sits on the wall plane z = 0 (wall behind, +Z); the torch leans out toward -Z.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -2..2, y -9..21, z -12..0 units (0.14 x 0.85 x 0.33 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 14.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 30 x 12 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z -6\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): burning\n- `unlit`: snuffed: charred head with one dull ember\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 19, -10)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ember, glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_2, glow_flame_tongue\n\n## Notes\n\n- Origin is the bracket centre on the wall face; place it about 2 m up a wall.\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"plate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,-5.0,-0.8],"to":[2.5,5.0,0.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,9.5,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.2,0.0,11.0,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4.5,0.0,9.5,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.2,0.0,11.0,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8.5,27.2,13.5,28.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8.5,2