 at x 0, z -6\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `lit` (visible by default): burning\n- `unlit`: snuffed: charred head with one dull ember\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `flicker` | 0.8 | loop | the flame group `flame` jitters (the light flicker itself is the game's) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 19, -10)\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ember, glow_flame, glow_flame_1, glow_flame_2, glow_flame_tongue\n\n## Notes\n\n- Origin is the bracket centre on the wall face; place it about 2 m up a wall.\n"}